{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice'n'sphere is a relaxed puzzle game. You are a sphere that pushes around dice. To clear a level, every goal in the level must be filled with an appropriate dice. To get dice with the correct value, you will have to modify, split and stack them. But beware: Some levels will have extra challenges to tackle...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088080/extras/21ba31b195306ffb9f133c851101372a.poster.avif?t=1769950462\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088080/extras/21ba31b195306ffb9f133c851101372a.webm?t=1769950462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088080/extras/21ba31b195306ffb9f133c851101372a.mp4?t=1769950462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic, Sokoban-style gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill, lo-fi soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088080/extras/5c70e61426b6c9efabbfd7ceea102016.poster.avif?t=1769950462\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088080/extras/5c70e61426b6c9efabbfd7ceea102016.webm?t=1769950462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088080/extras/5c70e61426b6c9efabbfd7ceea102016.mp4?t=1769950462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steam